  "description": "A story of triplets struggling to fulfill their older sibling's unrequited love! \n\nThe first, Chae Hana, has had four failed crushes.\nThe second, Chae Doo In, who hates love.\nThe third, Chae Seong, who somehow makes things worse even when he helps. \n\nShe doesn't want her fifth crush to be a failure, so she asks her siblings to help her, and the guy she's crushing on is the most popular guy in school.\nWill the twins succeed this time? \n\n(Source: Naver Series, translated)",
